# @req: REQ-SSPEC-LOCAL-001
step("Verify: omits the presenter-notes block when notes are empty")
val html = render_slide_html(content_slide("s7", "Agenda", "First point"))
expect(html.contains("slide-notes")).to_be(false)
```

</details>

